    {
      "id": "c814b152-5d60-4286-a6e1-f5e575d1aa8f",
      "title": "Leia a nota e compare mentalmente o momento de explicar com o momento de entender.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1d465d69-d4a8-419d-adc5-f34731eb79bd",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>entender</strong> fala do resultado: a ideia já faz sentido para você.</p><p>Em sala, ele aparece quando a pergunta, a resposta ou a tarefa deixam de parecer confusas.</p><p>Compare assim: primeiro alguem <strong>explica</strong>; depois voce <strong>entende</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c3312e273a15409eaf863c189ea85a80_b03-entender.mp3?Expires=1794099530&Signature=lO9HyW-0dF3VT-GHMSRKWIdy4uj3jg2hXz4CVGmHBS0UhilaFRbS1wYUv1hXTIPyDYi6bx-ka7ceEVDnt-4pzEuTSbSheWp1FlHYlTNN8Yk4AVZcpIZp2xCLGePGnyCkyw3-qmc1uAG8swjqHr7Mtoqx22x6IKXb09rMAwgB7rf9AlLHJxG3FGqP~13a-X1Mr2YGII3TZIgaRDUugc-ddmFJlHk1g0mPXfBeZwFdn8L4ELbcKmNiAdW2EaC-tTjTOi4-e2F4GDKdTKGPPrly4-qqhvo3ttOpiF1byBdrEYOPv69EHMMZ66EDgooaaJ7hdgc0rJMkRa7KiIyHxXL5dA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
