    {
      "id": "a5001174-27f5-4394-83e6-c13ae4077a8b",
      "title": "Escute a expressão inteira e ligue o espanhol a um deslize comum de estudo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "3dfbec52-4161-4414-971b-a89f80a50bfa",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e observe a expressão.</p><p><strong>cometer un error</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>cometer um erro</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/ae887d25093f4d998949249650c3a4e1_b01-classroom-study-context.png?Expires=1794099530&Signature=H1APsDRnytgOqKXj1XA0ZJbjTVEl~uotYWoA-5tYxSvUX3FMHhwU~2LgUKBrl-gmIJ2kofCIQtxF0JDQuWcmVL4Af5cznwtu5OOOHifwuXtQ4Rgb2Gq8XntzGcs8eeBA8r3~iIxnLe~d7jx4edyxUeyxaHt6Z6QbTtINUXqYwM0yKEZ0NkkpCXQwWQKoumRW~ghseYIZc-2L6R9hPVNYUXvXW1t4LvQ~qEpugkd88uat9MEFimwF3A5t2B7FItKx9o6rdpRGxLgSjSFaOebD62WvlJNFmN1upscqtIMoEvF156bpfaraItUl0UGHfUsPISka3cHrucW45WSeyLCyeA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
