    {
      "id": "c0330eb3-87d0-41f6-9fbc-5800c86d8a55",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e repare que a expressão trata o erro como parte normal do processo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "867dfe23-48c1-4c67-9000-0cc0ae4ea3c2",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>cometer un error</strong> é a forma natural de falar de um erro em espanhol.</p><p>Ela serve para comentar deslizes em conta, resposta, leitura ou escrita sem transformar o erro no centro da conversa.</p><p>Em contexto de estudo, a expressão combina bem com correção, prática e tentativa de novo.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/dd54a1d70d664f60a6545c82fdaddfb7_b05-cometer-un-error.mp3?Expires=1794099530&Signature=q1aciYOBjuPBlQQSeFMyq2E0GYhq47~cdQIrNZQudsxMLvXSbKskObQ9FAZnxBXB6rwjoWFB2UjIMrdjrUlB-yIBYmQ65p5W~9kEtxWew46AqPcTWfeEuwrXNTeHqTEsM8~a~yf49hVH6aSrf9emcePjeKZuo3zCBu9~WyVECliGMGyzTuEeDXUi--VCgZjGZcrYB3gvxr01oBKcqLC6mGDtr1K1hvFTrFXQ-0GyjWMA62iYepnj-RxbTrkwrPBEUSH1LPYKRyCFOGArtcf~A8S~cjMfmkbGyqnlcBmx7A85w1MSzZV2NcjcJyqydIaV2X0NDzHw4LRPZ90PnZTqxw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8a6a77db-d946-4587-b6dc-1ebef3509500",
      "title": "Escute a expressão e associe o sentido a situações em que há coisa demais para acompanhar.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "9ab38066-2037-4bdb-83ea-41017624166c",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e observe a expressão.</p><p><strong>un montón de</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>um monte de</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/ae887d25093f4d998949249650c3a4e1_b01-classroom-study-context.png?Expires=1794099530&Signature=H1APsDRnytgOqKXj1XA0ZJbjTVEl~uotYWoA-5tYxSvUX3FMHhwU~2LgUKBrl-gmIJ2kofCIQtxF0JDQuWcmVL4Af5cznwtu5OOOHifwuXtQ4Rgb2Gq8XntzGcs8eeBA8r3~iIxnLe~d7jx4edyxUeyxaHt6Z6QbTtINUXqYwM0yKEZ0NkkpCXQwWQKoumRW~ghseYIZc-2L6R9hPVNYUXvXW1t4LvQ~qEpugkd88uat9MEFimwF3A5t2B7FItKx9o6rdpRGxLgSjSFaOebD62WvlJNFmN1upscqtIMoEvF156bpfaraItUl0UGHfUsPISka3cHrucW45WSeyLCyeA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/2e5b77bff9d14857b9503226ee989ed1_b07-un-monton-de.mp3?Expires=1794099530&Signature=MijHcs9FWRxy1Vb6kvcwwcicQUvl571JvZ5hgnaITLYm9jvNNbKh5zveAjgrOykBkMh-W-NX8NlrXgoDsQ-O~cBReJn1N6X0xdDG09GqCcLa9Ot4ohz5wkVVNgNxUwQUX8Fn6N9d91kpjBtCIog7ZT60gFoRjnJF0QGOMdgqvu9mG34mnkDOu8Aww6Fk2I80Rb2Dwd5fCZfAtzgDflKwLQnOBQ-jrASgKlYwrOuwINWtwQVpP5FPI0tzsAl828qG1sD1nVolBSgZC0seyMZyCF1X1mtTzXrPzUiAvS9V7Ez9M8eFW84m0SyVPxnZzXJ8zTLD9RpI48rs0UiMSXf6IA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
